  "name": "Sweet and Sour Chicken",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken with pineapple, peppers, and a tangy-sweet sauce",
  "description": "Lightly coated chicken is browned, then combined with tender vegetables and a bright pineapple sauce for an easy savory-sweet meal.",
